 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Label Management (6MT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa21bbe6344dc491b91c89fec2ac9ef30\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21bbe6344dc491b91c89fec2ac9ef30__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables you to create and design label templates in external systems and use them in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> via integration. Additionally, you can collect or calculate relevant product data for labels, varying by country/region or language in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> (for example, Dangerous Goods classifications, GHS classification). Furthermore, you can create print requests for labels in external systems using a third-party output management system.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The labels can then be placed on products and shipped to customers.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21bbe6344dc491b91c89fec2ac9ef30__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Design templates for labels</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Set up configurations for labels</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send requests to print labels</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21bbe6344dc491b91c89fec2ac9ef30__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate with partner solutions to enable the selection of label template designs</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Link data from SAP with data from partner solutions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve configurations for labels</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enhance the use of compliance datа to help ensure better compliance and lower costs</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>标签管理 (6MT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa21bbe6344dc491b91c89fec2ac9ef30\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21bbe6344dc491b91c89fec2ac9ef30__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目使您能够在外部系统中创建和设计标签模板，并通过集成在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中使用它们。此外，您可以在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中收集或计算标签的相关产品数据，这些数据因国家/地区或语言而异（例如，危险品分类、GHS 分类）。此外，您可以使用第三方输出管理系统为外部系统中的标签创建打印请求。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">然后，可以将标签放入产品并运送给客户。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21bbe6344dc491b91c89fec2ac9ef30__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">设计标签模板</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">设置标签配置</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发送打印标签请求</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21bbe6344dc491b91c89fec2ac9ef30__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">与合作伙伴解决方案集成，支持选择标签模板设计</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将 SAP 数据与合作伙伴解决方案中的数据联系起来</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">改进标签配置</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">加强合规性数据的使用，以帮助确保更好的合规性并降低成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
